+ manual [page]
- Try typing "man man" for the manual for the manual program - man.

+ how do i (use|run) *
@ manual

+ how do i (use|run) the (command|program) *
@ manual

+ what are the [basic] commands
- Use "ls" to list files, "cd" to change folders, and "pwd" to see your current folder path.

+ how do i (close|exit|quit|stop) *
- Sometimes a program can be cancelled by pressing ctrl+c, sometimes by pressing the escape key, or by typing :q.

+ ram
- Try typing "free -m". See "man free".

